  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop on protection &amp; Early recovery</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop on &#x201c;Protection and Early Recovery&#x201d; This workshop will be held in Goma from 04 to 06 September 2011 and whose participants are the partners involved in the livelihoods program and the sexual violence Project, CAFOD&#x2019;s programme staff, and some invited NGO working in the field of protection, in particular sister agencies of CI.
The Purpose of this workshop is the Collect and discuss the main information to design a new protection and early recovery programme which will be developed by cafod and his partner in East DRC for the next five year.</narrative>
  </description>
